Urban areas present unique challenges for drone-based deliveries due to the spatially and temporally variable nature of the wind field at low altitudes. In this paper, we propose a novel approach to address these challenges and ensure safe and reliable drone delivery routings in windy urban environments. Our approach incorporates the stochastic and spatially heterogeneous urban wind field using scenario-based 
